# Frontend (apps/web)

`pages/`, `layouts/`, `components/{layout,home,sections,widgets,product}/`, `composables/`, `locales/`, `content/`, `utils/`.

- `useSeoMeta` + hreflang helpers  
- Prefer `NuxtImg`  
- `localePath` for links  
- Home may use `layout: false`  

Maps: `.ai/SMART_CONTEXT.md`, `.ai/COMPONENT_GUIDE.md`.
